1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:09,462
Namaste!

2
00:00:09,502 --> 00:00:12,560
Medoro Pharmacy mein aapka swagat hai.

3
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:19,409
Medoro Pharmacy Bharat ki medical stores ke liye
bana software hai, jismein billing,

4
00:00:19,449 --> 00:00:24,137
inventory, purchase, GST aur accounting, sab ek
jagah hai.

5
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:26,268
Yeh kiske liye hai?

6
00:00:26,308 --> 00:00:32,088
Mohalle ki medical store aur retail pharmacy,
aspataal aur clinic ki pharmacy,

7
00:00:32,128 --> 00:00:35,819
aur kai branches wali pharmacy chains, sabke
liye.

8
00:00:36,577 --> 00:00:42,082
Mukhya faayde: keyboard se tez billing, FEFO se
expiry ka kam nuksaan,

9
00:00:42,122 --> 00:00:48,974
Schedule H ki jaanch, GST reports, internet band
hone par bhi billing, Hindi interface,

10
00:00:49,014 --> 00:00:51,985
aur data aapke apne Google Drive mein.

11
00:00:52,762 --> 00:00:55,133
Ab software ke andar chalte hain.

12
00:00:55,173 --> 00:01:00,468
Yeh hamaari demo pharmacy ka dashboard hai,
Medoro Demo Pharmacy, Ranchi,

13
00:01:00,508 --> 00:01:04,414
jismein pichhle ek mahine ka kaalpanik data
bhara hai.

14
00:01:05,174 --> 00:01:09,792
Upar aaj ki bikri, margin, khareed, kharch aur
bakaaya.

15
00:01:09,832 --> 00:01:13,095
Beech mein bikri ka chart aur insights.

16
00:01:13,135 --> 00:01:17,161
Neeche low stock, expiry aur branch performance.

17
00:01:17,201 --> 00:01:21,311
In sabko hum agle parts mein vistaar se
dekhenge.
